  "lines": [
   {
    "seg": "hook",
    "at": 0.8,
    "text": "It's two in the afternoon in Kaffrine. Forty-one degrees in the shade."
   },
   {
    "seg": "shock",
    "at": 0.3,
    "text": "It only takes two hours. Two hours out of the cold, and a vaccine protects no one."
   },
   {
    "seg": "stat",
    "at": 0.3,
    "text": "One sensitive product in four is lost before it arrives. Silently. Without proof."
   },
   {
    "seg": "human",
    "at": 0.4,
    "text": "This is Awa. A nurse. Twelve villages, one cool box, and no proof the cold held."
   },
   {
    "seg": "question",
    "at": 0.3,
    "text": "So, on the road, who keeps it cold when nobody is watching?"
   },
   {
    "seg": "brief",
    "at": 0.4,
    "text": "That question was asked by Partner. Challenge number two: guarantee the cold chain down to the last mile."
   },
   {
    "text": "Here is our answer: Froida.",
    "reveal": "answer"
   },
   {
    "seg": "trio",
    "at": 0.2,
    "text": "The cold, measured. The depot, alerted. The patient, protected."
   },
   {
    "seg": "product",
    "at": 0.3,
    "reveal": 0,
    "text": "A probe at the heart of the cool box."
   },
   {
    "reveal": 1,
    "text": "A position on the map."
   },
   {
    "reveal": 2,
    "text": "Thirty days of battery, even far from everything."
   },
   {
    "reveal": 3,
    "text": "And the moment the temperature slips, the alert goes out. Within a second."
   },
   {
    "seg": "platform",
    "at": 0.3,
    "text": "At the depot, every cool box appears in real time. The curve as proof. The position as a guarantee. The manager no longer guesses. They know."
   },
   {
    "seg": "impact",
    "at": 0.3,
    "text": "Three minutes to react, instead of a lost day."
   },
   {
    "seg": "value",
    "at": 0.3,
    "text": "And for Partner, every measured trip becomes a decision."
   },
   {
    "reveal": 1,
    "text": "A deviation detected is a batch saved."
   },
   {
    "reveal": 3,
    "text": "A batch saved is trust earned."
   },
   {
    "seg": "network",
    "at": 0.3,
    "text": "Your clients, pharmacies, health centres, hospitals, wholesalers, NGOs, gain proof of quality. And you gain their loyalty."
   },
   {
    "seg": "pilot",
    "at": 0.3,
    "reveal": 0,
    "text": "We propose a pilot. On your routes, with your teams."
   },
   {
    "reveal": 1,
    "text": "You measure. You validate."
   },
   {
    "reveal": 2,
    "text": "Then we roll out, together, across your whole network."
   },
   {
    "seg": "end",
    "at": 0.4,
    "text": "So, on the road, who keeps it cold? From now on, we do."
   },
   {
    "reveal": "final",
    "gain": 1.15,
    "text": "Thank you."
   }
